WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.078 --> 00:00:19.892
"Help!" cried Peter.

2
00:00:19.893 --> 00:00:24.892
"I'm stuck in this net!"

3
00:00:24.893 --> 00:00:30.150
Some birds flew over to Peter.

4
00:00:30.151 --> 00:00:34.123
They tried to help him.

5
00:00:34.124 --> 00:00:38.155
"Don't give up!" called one bird.

6
00:00:38.156 --> 00:00:46.154
"Keep trying to get free!"

7
00:00:46.155 --> 00:00:50.319
"Take off your jacket!" shouted another.

8
00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:52.948
Peter stopped crying.

9
00:00:52.949 --> 00:00:56.734
Quickly Peter slipped out of his jacket.

10
00:00:56.735 --> 00:01:03.464
Now he was free!

11
00:01:03.465 --> 00:01:07.224
But the farmer was still chasing him.

12
00:01:07.225 --> 00:01:10.292
Peter ran away fast.

13
00:01:10.293 --> 00:01:17.897
"Get back here!" cried the farmer.

14
00:01:17.898 --> 00:01:22.861
Peter dashed into a shed.

15
00:01:22.862 --> 00:01:27.625
It was filled with garden tools.

16
00:01:27.626 --> 00:01:31.283
Peter leaped into a watering can.

17
00:01:31.284 --> 00:01:36.468
Splash! The can was filled with icy water.

18
00:01:36.469 --> 00:01:40.483
"Brr!" said Peter.

19
00:01:40.484 --> 00:01:43.937
The farmer rushed into the shed.

20
00:01:43.938 --> 00:01:48.886
"Where is that rabbit?" said the farmer.

21
00:01:48.887 --> 00:01:51.064
Peter shivered.

22
00:01:51.065 --> 00:01:54.899
He heard the farmer moving things around.

23
00:01:54.900 --> 00:01:59.790
The man was looking for Peter.

24
00:01:59.791 --> 00:02:04.037
"Where are you, rabbit?" muttered the farmer.

25
00:02:04.038 --> 00:02:08.138
The farmer's footsteps were close now.

26
00:02:08.139 --> 00:02:11.382
"Uh-oh," whispered Peter.

27
00:02:11.383 --> 00:02:14.496
He felt a tickle in his nose.

28
00:02:14.497 --> 00:02:17.021
The tickle grew worse.

29
00:02:17.022 --> 00:02:20.964
"Ah-choo!" Peter sneezed.

30
00:02:20.965 --> 00:02:28.610
"Aha!" cried the farmer.
